WEBVTT

00:28:56.387 --> 00:29:00.188
And in each of those other three,
China has a meaningful advantage.

00:29:00.212 --> 00:29:02.768
They are basically
entrepreneurial culture,

00:29:02.792 --> 00:29:05.641
data and the attitude of the government.

00:29:05.665 --> 00:29:07.315
And I'd love to talk through them.

00:29:07.339 --> 00:29:11.944
Both in your TED Talk and in your book,
you give really amazing examples

00:29:11.968 --> 00:29:17.728
of the entrepreneurial, gladiatorial
culture that you talk about.

00:29:17.752 --> 00:29:22.929
Give us a story of a Chinese
gladiatorial entrepreneur at work.

00:29:23.673 --> 00:29:29.464
KFL: Well, the gladiatorial competition
refers to, in a particular field,

00:29:29.488 --> 00:29:32.662
companies fight to the death
and only one is left.